DISKVIEW(1)

NAME
    diskview - show a graphical disk usage view

SYNOPSIS
    diskview

DESCRIPTION
    Displays a graphical view of ext2 disk usage and free space using the
    SmallOS framebuffer.  Allocated and free block regions are drawn from the
    mounted filesystem's allocation map.

KEYS
    Press any key to close the view and return to the shell.

SEE ALSO
    bmpview(1), fsread(1), meminfo(1)
